{"call_id": "781733bc40994d85a4735b428d2a44d2", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/fullbench/runs/fad/yelp/query5/full-01/results/781733bc40994d85a4735b428d2a44d2.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"submitted\": true, \"answer\": \"Answer: Pennsylvania (PA)\\n\\n- Pennsylvania has the highest number of businesses that offer WiFi: 8 businesses\\n  (businessid_89, businessid_97, businessid_67, businessid_77, businessid_86,\\n   businessid_40, businessid_44, businessid_82).\\n- The average rating for those WiFi-offering businesses is approximately 3.48\\n  (3.484, computed over 281 reviews in the user_database review table).\\n\\nMethod:\\n1. Queried the MongoDB business collection for businesses whose attributes.WiFi\\n   value indicates WiFi is offered (\\\"free\\\" or \\\"paid\\\", excluding \\\"no\\\" variants).\\n   21 such U.S. businesses were found (Canadian entries like Edmonton, AB excluded).\\n2. Extracted the U.S. state from each business's description field.\\n   State counts: PA=8, FL=5, MO=2, IN=2, LA=1, IL=1, NV=1, ID=1. Pennsylvania leads.\\n3. Joined to the DuckDB review table (business_id \\\"businessid_N\\\" maps to\\n   \\\"businessref_N\\\") and averaged the ratings for the 8 PA businesses:\\n   AVG(rating) = 3.484 across 281 reviews.\\n\"}", "truncated": false}
